  UPDATE news_items SET post_text = $np$Some researchers argue archaeological dating methods have存在的问题 — Göbekli Tepe was dated to the Pre-Pottery Neolithic (c. 9500–8000 BCE) using radiocarbon dating, which confirmed earlier suspicions of its great age. The debate over dating methodologies continues within the field.$np$ WHERE id = 5797 AND headline = $oh$Academia uses biased dating methods influenced by Bible$oh$ AND summary = $os$Academia uses biased dating methods influenced by Bible. The 'DiCaprio dating' system confuses minimum with maximum dates Archaeologists date to the youngest spectrum possible 19th century scholars pushed a 6,000-year date based on Bible calculations$os$ AND post_text = $op$Some researchers argue archaeological dating methods have problems — Göbekli Tepe was dated to the Pre-Pottery Neolithic (c. 9500–8000 BCE) using radiocarbon dating, which confirmed earlier suspicions of its great age. The debate over dating methodologies continues within the field.$op$ AND facts = $of$["The 'DiCaprio dating' system confuses minimum with maximum dates", "Archaeologists date to the youngest spectrum possible", "19th century scholars pushed a 6,000-year date based on Bible calculations", "Göbekli Tepe was only accepted as 9,000 years old after carbon dating became available", "If discovered 20 years earlier, it would not have been attributed to its current age", "Carbon dating is rarely done on old structures due to funding priorities"]$of$::jsonb;
