  UPDATE news_items SET headline = $nh$Geologists debate natural volcanic formation vs人工 structure$nh$, summary = $ns$Geologists debate natural volcanic formation vs人工 structure. Discussion centers on whether the formation is natural or constructed One hypothesis is that it could be a volcanic dyke Comparison made to megalithic structures observed in Peru$ns$ WHERE id = 6342 AND headline = $oh$Geologists debate natural volcanic formation vs man-made structure$oh$ AND summary = $os$Geologists debate natural volcanic formation vs man-made structure. Discussion centers on whether the formation is natural or constructed One hypothesis is that it could be a volcanic dyke Comparison made to megalithic structures observed in Peru$os$ AND post_text = $op$The Natural Wall remains a mystery. One side looks like a volcanic dyke, but the block-like appearance on the other side resembles megalithic structures found in Peru. Some blocks even have rolled edges like placed stones. Locals weigh in on the debate 🗿

Note: The formation is officially called the 'Natural Wall' and is described by geologists as a resistant vertical bed of Jacobsville Sandstone, not a volcanic dyke. The volcanic dyke hypothesis is one proposed by non-expert observers to explain its appearance.$op$ AND facts = $of$["Discussion centers on whether the formation is natural or constructed", "One hypothesis is that it could be a volcanic dyke", "Comparison made to megalithic structures observed in Peru", "On one side, the formation appears more block-like and constructed", "On the other side, the rock appears more naturally fractured like a volcanic dyke should", "Local Michigan experts give their opinion on the formation", "The formation has rolled edges on some blocks, similar to placed stones", "Water runs through the ravine with multiple veins crossing the area"]$of$::jsonb;
